                                                "sense_id": "de9b3b4f-11b0-3295-9e20-9dedd94a2247",
                                                "text": "But now, a new awareness of the issue is raising questions about the status of women in China, as well as other rights issues like the hukou, or residency permit, a central tool of population control passed down from the Maoist era that restricts movement by linking people to the towns of their birth."
